  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth sowing their future</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Desarrollo Autogestionario, A.C. (AUGE) will offer training in job skills to 300 young Mexicans, between the ages of 16 and 22, from 40 communities in six municipalities surrounding Xalapa, Veracruz, and will support their small enterprises or further education. A mobile training center developed with project funds will allow AUGE to continuing activities beyond the grant period. In addition to the trainees, 1,200 family members are expected to benefit.</narrative>
  </description>
